# Every configuration value this project reads, with a safe placeholder and one line explaining it.
# This file is committed. `.env` never is.
#
# /onboard fills this in from the chosen stack. Real values live in the secret manager named in
# docs/ops/environments.md. Agents must never read, print or write real secret values.

# NODE_ENV=development          # development | test | production
# PORT=3000                     # port the local dev server binds to
